      "description": "\\u0041 and \\/ decode to the same characters as A and /.",
      "input": "\"\\u0041\\/B\"",
      "expected": "\"A/B\"",
      "expectedSha256": "aafa38013a7831c95664c669e5f4084858bbf19ab582aae84ab926ea3cd26608"
    },
    {
      "id": "non-ascii-escaped",
